{"learnerLanguage":"pt","spokenSeconds":0,"turns":[{"speaker":"character","text":"Now, I'd like you to compare these photographs and say why the people might have chosen to learn these skills in these ways. You have about a minute."},{"speaker":"learner","text":"In the first photo a young woman is learning to make bread with an older man, maybe her grandfather, at home. In the second photo there is a pottery class with several people. I think the woman chose to learn at home because it's more personal and relaxed, while the people in the class probably wanted a teacher and to meet other people."},{"speaker":"learner","text":"Also, learning in a group can be more motivating, but it's more expensive. At home you can make mistakes without feeling embarrassed."},{"speaker":"character","text":"Thank you. Which of these skills would you prefer to learn, and why?"},{"speaker":"learner","text":"I'd prefer pottery, because I spend all day in front of a computer and I want to do something with my hands."}],"criteria":[{"display":"band","halfBands":true,"levelBand":3,"maxBand":5,"scope":"test","key":"grammarVocabulary","name":"Grammar and Vocabulary","sound":false,"voiceOnly":false},{"display":"band","halfBands":true,"levelBand":3,"maxBand":5,"scope":"test","key":"discourse","name":"Discourse Management","sound":false,"voiceOnly":false},{"display":"band","halfBands":true,"levelBand":3,"maxBand":5,"scope":"test","key":"pronunciation","name":"Pronunciation","sound":true,"voiceOnly":true},{"display":"band","halfBands":true,"levelBand":3,"maxBand":5,"scope":"test","key":"global","name":"Global Achievement","sound":false,"voiceOnly":false}],"exam":"cambridge","level":"B2","task":{"brief":"The candidate compares two photographs and answers the question printed above them, speaking for a minute without interruption; then the examiner asks a short question about the photos.","minutes":{"max":2,"min":1},"name":"Part 2: Long turn","role":"examiner"},"title":"B2 First"}